   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>A marathon runner completes a <span data-math=\"42.188\\,\\text{km}\">42.188\\,\\text{km}</span> course in <span data-math=\"2\\,\\text{h}\">2\\,\\text{h}</span>, <span data-math=\"30\\,\\text{min}\">30\\,\\text{min}</span>, and <span data-math=\"12\\,\\text{s}\">12\\,\\text{s}</span>. There is an uncertainty of <span data-math=\"25\\,\\text{m}\">25\\,\\text{m}</span> in the distance traveled and an uncertainty of <span data-math=\"1\\,\\text{s}\">1\\,\\text{s}</span> in the elapsed time.</p>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Calculate the percent uncertainty in the distance.</li>\n  <li>Calculate the uncertainty in the elapsed time.</li>\n  <li>What is the average speed in meters per second?</li>\n  <li>What is the uncertainty in the average speed?</li>\n</ol>\n",
